LAMMPS (23 Jun 2022 - Update 1)
# ==============================================================================
# Passo 1.1: Verificacao do potencial Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy a 0 K
# Calcula: a0, Ecoh, matriz C_IJ completa (6x6) por diferencas centrais, e Ev^f
# ==============================================================================
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

variable        n     equal 6
variable        delta equal 1.0e-3

lattice         fcc 3.615
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 3.615 3.615 3.615
region          box prism 0 ${n} 0 ${n} 0 ${n} 0.0 0.0 0.0
region          box prism 0 6 0 ${n} 0 ${n} 0.0 0.0 0.0
region          box prism 0 6 0 6 0 ${n} 0.0 0.0 0.0
region          box prism 0 6 0 6 0 6 0.0 0.0 0.0
create_box      1 box
Created triclinic box = (0 0 0) to (21.69 21.69 21.69) with tilt (0 0 0)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms    1 box
Created 864 atoms
  using lattice units in triclinic box = (0 0 0) to (21.69 21.69 21.69) with tilt (0 0 0)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.005 seconds
mass            1 63.546

pair_style      eam/alloy
pair_coeff      * * ../00_potentials/Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy Cu
Reading eam/alloy potential file ../00_potentials/Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy with DATE: 2007-10-12

neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes

thermo          50
thermo_style    custom step pe lx ly lz pxx pyy pzz pyz pxz pxy

# 1. Estado de referencia a pressao nula (0 K)
fix             relax all box/relax iso 0.0 vmax 0.001
min_style       cg
minimize        0.0 1.0e-12 10000 100000
